WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520
You must do what you promised

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:06,860
This is the most basic principle of life. Hello, you have backbone.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,900
You have integrity, right?

4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,820
You just plan to sleep here and not leave, right?

5
00:00:10,560 --> 00:00:16,480
This is my job, okay, you asked for it, I didn’t force you to do it. If you like to sleep on the floor, then just keep sleeping.

6
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:17,680
Don't blame me if you freeze to death

7
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,500
Where did my dad find this weird thing?

8
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,900
You came here to make me angry, right?

9
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,460
If you like sleeping here, continue

10
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,980
I'm freezing to death and I'm still cleaning up

11
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:30,020
We can't really let him freeze outside all night. Why did you come in here?

12
00:00:30,020 --> 00:00:32,420
You put your bag on your back and let me come in and sleep.

13
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:34,740
What's wrong? I can't understand the words. Is it inappropriate?

14
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,740
You won't come in and sleep, right?

15
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,460
Okay, I'll call my dad

16
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,660
I said you are not willing to protect me at all and are not willing to enter.

17
00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:40,700
What can I say to protect me?

18
00:00:46,930 --> 00:00:49,450
No one lives in the house downstairs. You can find it yourself.

19
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:51,050
Which room do you want to stay in?

20
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:52,090
There's everything you can carry on your back

21
00:00:52,570 --> 00:00:53,850
But there's one thing I want to warn you about

22
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,500
You are not allowed to go upstairs

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:58,820
No matter what happens, you are not allowed to go upstairs. Not even a step is allowed.

24
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:04,060
If you want to catch up upstairs, I will die with you. Do you hear me?

25
00:01:04,730 --> 00:01:06,450
You thought I was joking, right?

26
00:01:06,690 --> 00:01:09,200
I know you are serious, just know

27
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:10,800
If you don't want to die, don't go upstairs
